guide nood/07-30-40
title 30-40 Nood: RFK, SM Graveyard, Library, Armory, RFD, Cathedral
levels 30-40
zone map 1456
faction Horde
folder Nood Guide
why Dungeon-focused leveling. When you reach a dungeon's level you run it first, then do only the most efficient zone quests until the next dungeon. 30-40: Razorfen Kraul 31 -> SM Graveyard and Library 32-33 (together) -> The Drowne…
coords era
next nood/08-40-50
