step
  tip Thunder Bluff Fly to Thunder Bluff (a quick stop for a Razorfen Kraul quest).
  note "* Razorfen Kraul — Lv31.3 -> about Lv32.0 · recommended Lv30-31 (healer 30 · tank/DPS 31)"
  note "! Your Hearthstone must be set to Orgrimmar. If it's set elsewhere, fly or run to Orgrimmar instead of hearthing."
  note "Orgrimmar Hearth to Orgrimmar (if your Hearthstone is on cooldown, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar from the tower east of Undercity)."
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

