step
  accept 3523 -- Accept from Belnistrasz inside the dungeon: Scourge of the Downs — *Reward chain · Dungeon prereq (Razorfen Downs)
  turnin 3523 -- Hand the Oathstone back to him right away: Scourge of the Downs — *Reward chain · Dungeon prereq (Razorfen Downs)
  accept 3525 -- Then accept (escort): Extinguishing the Idol — *Reward
  complete 3525 -- Escort Belnistrasz to the idol and protect him until the ritual ends: Extinguishing the Idol
  turnin 3525 -- When the ritual ends, click the brazier (*reward): Extinguishing the Idol

